Arbor
=====

Arbor is a fork of Nushell.

Upstream project: Nushell (https://github.com/nushell/nushell)
Upstream version forked from: 0.117.0
Upstream commit: a481925 (tag 0.117.0)
Fork date: 2026-11-10

Arbor is licensed under the MIT License. The original Nushell copyright
notice is preserved in full in the LICENSE file and applies to all code
inherited from Nushell. See LICENSE.

Changes made in this fork relative to upstream 0.117.0:

  * Renamed the executable from `nu` to `arbor`.
  * Renamed the default configuration, data and cache directories from
    `nushell` to `arbor` (e.g. `~/.config/arbor`).
  * Added automatic migration: if no Arbor configuration exists but a
    legacy `~/.config/nushell` (or `~/.config/waash`) directory is found,
    it is used as a fallback so existing setups keep working.
  * Rebranded user-facing strings, documentation and package metadata.

Arbor does not claim endorsement by or affiliation with the Nushell
Project. "Nushell" and the Nushell logo are used only to accurately
describe the origin of this code.

How to keep this fork current with upstream
-------------------------------------------

    git remote add upstream https://github.com/nushell/nushell
    git fetch upstream --tags
    git merge upstream/main

Because Arbor's changes are concentrated in package metadata, path
resolution (crates/nu-config/src/resolve.rs) and docs, upstream merges
should stay small and conflict-light.
